---
import SquarespaceFooter from '../components/SquarespaceFooter.astro';
import SquarespaceHeader from '../components/SquarespaceHeader.astro';
import type { ShellConfig } from '../config/shell';
import { shellConfig } from '../config/shell';
import SquarespaceShellLayout from '../layouts/SquarespaceShellLayout.astro';

const { config = shellConfig }: { config?: ShellConfig } = Astro.props;
---
<SquarespaceShellLayout config={config}>
  <div id="siteWrapper" class="clearfix site-wrapper">
    <SquarespaceHeader config={config} />

    <main id="page" class="ht-main" tabindex="-1">

      <!-- ======================================================
           SECTION 1 — HERO
           ====================================================== -->
      <section class="ht-tutoring-hero">
        <div class="ht-tutoring-hero__inner">
          <p class="ht-eyebrow ht-eyebrow--crimson">1-on-1 tutoring · Kansas City</p>
          <h1 class="ht-tutoring-hero__h1">
            The best way to prepare for the SAT and ACT is
            <em class="ht-tutoring-hero__em">not a class.</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="ht-tutoring-hero__lead">
            After teaching hundreds of students in both classrooms and
            one-on-one settings, I can tell you from experience: private
            tutoring outperforms test-prep classes every time — and costs
            about the same.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ======================================================
           SECTION 2 — WHY CLASSES FAIL
           ====================================================== -->
      <section class="ht-why-classes">
        <div class="ht-why-classes__inner">
          <div class="ht-section-hdr">
            <p class="ht-eyebrow ht-eyebrow--gold">Why classes don't work</p>
            <h2 class="ht-section-hdr__h2">Three reasons test-prep classes fall short — every time</h2>
            <p class="ht-section-hdr__lead">
              I've taught hundreds of students in classroom settings.
              Here's what I observed.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="ht-reason-grid">
            <div class="ht-reason-card">
              <p class="ht-reason-num">01 — Topics</p>
              <h3 class="ht-reason-card__h3">Classes can't focus on you</h3>
              <p class="ht-reason-card__body">
                Most students excel at either Math/Science or Reading/English —
                not both. A class follows a fixed syllabus covering everything,
                even topics you already know or will never need. One-on-one means
                we only work on what you actually need.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="ht-reason-card">
              <p class="ht-reason-num">02 — Pace</p>
              <h3 class="ht-reason-card__h3">One speed doesn't fit anyone</h3>
              <p class="ht-reason-card__body">
                When a class moves on before you're ready, you fall behind.
                When it moves too slowly, you stop paying attention. Private tutoring
                moves at exactly your pace — faster through your strengths, slower
                through your weaknesses.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="ht-reason-card">
              <p class="ht-reason-num">03 — Strategy</p>
              <h3 class="ht-reason-card__h3">Your approach has to be personal</h3>
              <p class="ht-reason-card__body">
                Not every student should attempt every question. Your optimal
                strategy depends on your current score, your reading speed, and the
                score you're targeting. That level of customization simply isn't
                possible in a group class.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ht-synopsis">
            <p class="ht-synopsis-attr">— Why classes are so common</p>
            <blockquote class="ht-synopsis__quote">
              Whatever benefits you get from test-prep classes are so minimal
              they virtually never justify the cost. Can you see a score increase
              with them? Yes. More than what a student would get by studying alone?
              In all likelihood, no.
            </blockquote>
            <p class="ht-synopsis__body">
              I say this as someone who has taught many hundreds of students in
              both classroom and one-on-one settings. So why do test prep companies
              offer classes? <strong>They are extremely profitable.</strong> Ten
              people paying $1,200, minus perhaps $1,000 for the teacher and
              supplies — that's a great business model. Of course they also offer
              private tutoring, but they price it so high that most people are
              steered toward the far more profitable classes.
            </p>
            <p class="ht-synopsis__body">
              The result: if you want test prep, you either pay exorbitant rates
              for private tutoring at a big company, or you settle for an
              ineffective class. I offer a better option.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ======================================================
           SECTION 3 — MY APPROACH
           ====================================================== -->
      <section class="ht-approach">
        <div class="ht-approach__inner">
          <div class="ht-gold-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="ht-eyebrow ht-eyebrow--gold">My approach</p>
          <h2 class="ht-approach__h2">I teach the SAT and ACT — not academic subjects</h2>
          <p class="ht-approach__body">
            I try to teach as little academic knowledge as possible. Instead,
            I teach the tests themselves. These exams are nothing but a set of
            repeating question types. I teach students to recognize each type
            and apply the same simple steps every time — a mechanical, learnable
            process.
          </p>
          <p class="ht-approach__body">
            I keep meticulous notes on what we've covered and what each student
            struggles with. Every subsequent session is built around improving
            those weaknesses and reinforcing the systematic approach. Homework is
            tailored to each student. By test day, my students have their exam
            planned down to the minute.
          </p>
          <p class="ht-approach__body">
            I've been doing this since 2006 — first at Kaplan, then at Get
            Smarter Prep, then on my own. Nearly 20 years of experience refining
            an approach that consistently gets results.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ======================================================
           SECTION 4 — PRICING
           ====================================================== -->
      <section id="pricing" class="ht-pricing">
        <div class="ht-pricing__inner">
          <div class="ht-section-hdr">
            <p class="ht-eyebrow ht-eyebrow--gold">Transparent pricing</p>
            <h2 class="ht-section-hdr__h2">What I charge — and how it compares</h2>
            <p class="ht-section-hdr__lead">
              I charge less than a third of what comparable experienced
              tutors cost at the major prep companies, and I'm better.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="ht-pricing-wrap">

            <!-- LEFT: pricing card -->
            <div class="ht-pricing-main">
              <p class="ht-eyebrow ht-eyebrow--crimson" style="margin-bottom:0.5rem">Hasan Tutoring</p>
              <div class="ht-price-display">
                <span class="ht-price-amount">$140</span>
                <span class="ht-price-label">/ hour</span>
              </div>
              <p class="ht-price-rec">
                Recommended: 1.5 hr sessions at $210 — starting 2–3 months
                before your exam
              </p>
              <ul class="ht-price-details">
                <li>SAT, ACT &amp; LSAT preparation</li>
                <li>Fully customized to your weaknesses</li>
                <li>Free practice test to establish baseline</li>
                <li>Meticulous session notes &amp; tailored homework</li>
                <li>Free initial consultation, no pressure</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- RIGHT: comparison card -->
            <div class="ht-pricing-compare">
              <p class="ht-compare-heading">Competitor rates</p>
              <div class="ht-compare-row">
                <span>Hasan Tutoring</span>
                <span class="ht-compare-row__price ht-compare-row__price--ours">$140/hr</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ht-compare-row">
                <span>Get Smarter Prep</span>
                <span class="ht-compare-row__price">$400/hr</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ht-compare-row">
                <span>Kaplan / Princeton Review</span>
                <span class="ht-compare-row__price">$250+/hr</span>
              </div>
              <div class="ht-compare-row ht-compare-row--last">
                <span>Test-prep class</span>
                <span class="ht-compare-row__price">$1,200+</span>
              </div>
              <p class="ht-compare-note">
                Classes cost as much as private tutoring and deliver far less.
                The math is simple.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ======================================================
           SECTION 5 — CTA STRIP
           ====================================================== -->
      <section class="ht-cta-strip">
        <div class="ht-cta-strip__inner">
          <h2 class="ht-cta-strip__h2">
            Free practice test.<br>
            No sales pitch. Ever.
          </h2>
          <p class="ht-cta-strip__body">
            Contact me and I'll provide a free recent SAT or ACT, answer any
            questions you have, and give you honest advice on how to proceed —
            whether that means working with me or not.
          </p>
          <div class="ht-cta-strip__btns">
            <a href="/contact" class="ht-btn ht-btn--white">Get in touch</a>
            <a href="mailto:Majid@HasanTutoring.com" class="ht-btn ht-btn--ghost">Majid@HasanTutoring.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <SquarespaceFooter config={config} />
  </div>

  <script is:inline defer="true" src={config.siteBundle} type="text/javascript"></script>
  <div id="yui3-css-stamp" style="position: absolute !important; visibility: hidden !important"></div>
</SquarespaceShellLayout>

<style>
  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Reset Squarespace container constraints on main
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  :global(#page.ht-main) {
    max-width: none !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    width: 100% !important;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Shared utilities
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
  }

  .ht-eyebrow--crimson {
    color: var(--color-accent-crimson);
  }

  .ht-eyebrow--gold {
    color: var(--color-accent-gold);
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 1 — HERO
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-tutoring-hero {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: clamp(12rem, 16vw, 15rem) var(--space-section-h) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ht-tutoring-hero__inner {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ht-tutoring-hero__h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .ht-tutoring-hero__em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ht-tutoring-hero__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 2 — WHY CLASSES FAIL
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-why-classes {
    background: var(--color-surface-warm);
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) var(--space-section-h);
  }

  .ht-why-classes__inner {
    max-width: var(--content-wide);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Section header — shared by §2 and §4 */
  .ht-section-hdr {
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .ht-section-hdr__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .ht-section-hdr__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  /* Reason cards grid */
  .ht-reason-grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .ht-reason-card {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-sm);
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
  }

  .ht-reason-num {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
    color: var(--color-accent-crimson);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
  }

  .ht-reason-card__h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .ht-reason-card__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Editorial synopsis */
  .ht-synopsis {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-crimson);
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-none);
  }

  .ht-synopsis-attr {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
    color: var(--color-accent-crimson);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  /* Override any global blockquote styles for this element only */
  .ht-synopsis__quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 1rem !important;
    border-left: none !important;
    padding-left: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    border: none !important;
  }

  .ht-synopsis__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .ht-synopsis__body:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 3 — MY APPROACH
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-approach {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) var(--space-section-h);
  }

  .ht-approach__inner {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ht-gold-rule {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .ht-approach__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .ht-approach__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .ht-approach__body:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 4 — PRICING
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-pricing {
    background: var(--color-surface-warm);
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) var(--space-section-h);
  }

  .ht-pricing__inner {
    max-width: var(--content-wide);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ht-pricing-wrap {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* LEFT — main pricing card */
  .ht-pricing-main {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  .ht-price-display {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .ht-price-amount {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ht-price-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ht-price-rec {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }

  .ht-price-details {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .ht-price-details li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.75rem 0 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }

  .ht-price-details li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 1.2em;
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-accent-gold);
  }

  /* RIGHT — comparison card */
  .ht-pricing-compare {
    flex: 0 0 280px;
    background: var(--color-surface-warm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .ht-compare-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-widest);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .ht-compare-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.625rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
  }

  .ht-compare-row--last {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ht-compare-row__price {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ht-compare-row__price--ours {
    color: var(--color-accent-crimson);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ht-compare-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     SECTION 5 — CTA STRIP
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-cta-strip {
    background: var(--color-bg-dark);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) var(--space-section-h);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-8);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .ht-cta-strip__btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Buttons
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .ht-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background var(--transition-fast), color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), opacity var(--transition-fast);
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ht-btn--white {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-bg-dark);
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  }

  .ht-btn--white:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ht-btn--ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
  }

  .ht-btn--ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  /* ----------------------------------------------------------------
     Responsive
  ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ht-reason-grid {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .ht-pricing-wrap {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .ht-pricing-compare {
      flex: none;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
